fluxcast (0.1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package, built per release for attachment to GitHub Releases.
    Built separately for each supported Debian and Ubuntu release; the
    version carries a ~codename suffix identifying which one.
  * Ships the application under /opt/fluxcast with a private virtualenv for
    the Python dependencies apt cannot satisfy (upnpclient is absent from the
    archive, python3-pychromecast is 9.4.0 against a 14.0.5 requirement).
  * Installs the wpa_supplicant D-Bus policy from meta/ and reloads dbus, so
    Wi-Fi Direct works without the separate privileged step the PyPI path
    needs (upstream issue #113).

 -- FluxCast Project <fluxcast@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 10 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
